        "description": "We develop a minimizing-movement framework for parametric finite element approximations of geometric gradient flows with admissible tangential motion. At each time step, the discrete variational problem combines a metric dissipation term for the normal displacement with a surface Dirichlet energy. T",
        "title_cn": "具有可接受切向运动的几何梯度流的最小化运动框架"
